sequenceDiagram
    participant User as npm run dev (node server.js)
    participant Server as Custom Node HTTP Server
    participant Next as Next.js Compiler
    participant Socket as Socket.io Server

    User->>Next: 1. next({ dev }) - Init Next.js compiler
    User->>Next: 2. app.prepare() - Compile pages
    Next-->>User: Done preparing
    User->>Server: 3. http.createServer(requestHandler)
    User->>Socket: 4. New Server(httpServer) - Attach WebSockets
    User->>Server: 5. listen(port)
